  "solution": "**Given**\n\nx² + 1 = 2x\n\n**Calculation**\n\nx² + 1 = 2x\n\n⇒ x² - 2x + 1 = 0\n\n⇒ x² - x - x + 1 = 0\n\n⇒ x(x - 1) - 1(x - 1) = 0\n\n⇒ (x - 1) (x - 1) = 0\n\n⇒ x = 1 and x = 1\n\nValue of x - (1over x)\n\n⇒ 1 - (1/1)\n\n⇒ 1 - 1\n\n⇒ 0\n\n**∴ x - (1/x) is 0.**",
